# CODEOWNERS configuration (opt-in via `cargo xtask github-setup <OWNER/REPO> --require-codeowners`)
#
# Fresh solo/template clones leave code-owner enforcement disabled by default so
# pull requests do not reference non-existent organization teams.
#
# When enabling `--require-codeowners` for a team repository, uncomment and
# replace `<your-org>/<your-team>` or `@<your-handle>` below:
#
# * @<your-org>/<your-team>
# /api/ @<your-org>/<your-team>
# /crates/quota-core/ @<your-org>/<your-team>
# /.github/ @<your-org>/<your-team>
